{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium heavy tank IS-1 (\u201945) (Rank IV, USSR)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium crew of 4 tankers of level 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 Gold</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The IS-1 (\u201945) is a Soviet heavy tank, representing a deep redesign and modernization of the KV-1/KV-1S series. While retaining some structural elements of its predecessors, it received reinforced armor and a new main gun. The vehicle performs well as a breakthrough tank: its strong frontal armor is capable of withstanding hits from anti-tank weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game, the tank comes equipped with a camouflage net and white identification stripes on the turret \u2014 a historical camouflage intended to prevent friendly fire from allied forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its main armament consists of an 85 mm D-5T gun with 59 rounds of ammunition, supported by a coaxial 7.62 mm DT machine gun with 2,520 rounds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905640?t=1758622207","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905640?t=1758622207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905640/c898ad318fc7ae8d9009aa0e6c8b092f79ac6971/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758622207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905640/c898ad318fc7ae8d9009aa0e6c8b092f79ac6971/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758622207","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium heavy tank IS-1 (\u201945) (Rank IV, USSR)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium crew of 4 tankers of level 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 Gold</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The IS-1 (\u201945) is a Soviet heavy tank, representing a deep redesign and modernization of the KV-1/KV-1S series. While retaining some structural elements of its predecessors, it received reinforced armor and a new main gun. The vehicle performs well as a breakthrough tank: its strong frontal armor is capable of withstanding hits from anti-tank weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game, the tank comes equipped with a camouflage net and white identification stripes on the turret \u2014 a historical camouflage intended to prevent friendly fire from allied forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its main armament consists of an 85 mm D-5T gun with 59 rounds of ammunition, supported by a coaxial 7.62 mm DT machine gun with 2,520 rounds.</p>","developers":["Darkflow Software"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2051620","name":"Enlisted"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905640/c64a45d12cb1180bedf72cd68ce0be01c0230e36/header.jpg?t=1758622207","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2020\u20142025 Gaijin Games Kft. All trademarks, logos and brand names are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cl